WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.339
Rosters ready? Tap "Coin toss".

2
00:00:02.389 --> 00:00:04.954
Put each team on its side: "Switch sides".

3
00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:09.641
The ball marks the first serve: "Switch serve" moves it.

4
00:00:09.691 --> 00:00:15.256
Coach and captain of each team sign: "Sign A" → "Coach".

5
00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:18.622
Sign, then "Save".

6
00:00:18.672 --> 00:00:24.154
Then the captain.

7
00:00:24.204 --> 00:00:29.161
Then "Confirm coin toss result". Missing signatures can follow during the warm-up.

8
00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:31.266
The starting line-ups: tap "Line-up A".

9
00:00:31.316 --> 00:00:38.316
Tap the players in order, position I (the server) first, then "Confirm".

10
00:00:41.056 --> 00:00:44.660
The captain is not on court: tap the "Game captain".

11
00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:51.710
The same for team B.

12
00:00:54.736 --> 00:00:56.536
Tap "Start set".

13
00:00:56.586 --> 00:01:00.152
A reminder: put the libero in if the team has one.

14
00:01:00.202 --> 00:01:03.273
Confirm the start time of the set.

15
00:01:03.323 --> 00:01:06.417
Set 1 is running.
